                            <comment id="17025774" author="agura" created="Wed, 29 Jan 2020 10:15:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ascherbakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ascherbakov&quot;&gt;ascherbakov&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=nizhikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;nizhikov&quot;&gt;nizhikov&lt;/a&gt; The change fixes NPE but not root cause. Root cause, I believe, is attempt to remove metric configuration on cache stop while it should be done only on cache destroy. &lt;/p&gt;

